Third party material redistributed in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. ST7305 reflective display driver
   components/rlcd/display_bsp.cpp
   components/rlcd/include/display_bsp.h

   Derived from Waveshare's ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 example code, licensed under the
   Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Copyright (c) Waveshare Electronics
   https://www.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2

   Modified for this project: converted to a C++ class, ported onto the ESP-IDF
   esp_lcd panel IO API, given a pixel lookup table for the landscape
   orientation, and extended with a windowed write and a low power mode helper.
   Some comments from the original remain in Chinese.

2. Montserrat typeface
   main/rlcd_font_bold_14.c
   main/rlcd_font_bold_18.c
   main/rlcd_font_bold_26.c
   main/rlcd_font_bold_40.c
   main/rlcd_font_bold_72.c
   main/rlcd_font_bold_104.c

   These files are 1 bit bitmap glyph tables generated with lv_font_conv from
   Montserrat-Bold.ttf, and are therefore derivatives of that typeface.
   Copyright 2011 The Montserrat Project Authors
   https://github.com/JulietaUla/Montserrat

   Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full licence text
   is in licenses/Montserrat-OFL.txt. The exact lv_font_conv command used for
   each size is recorded in the header comment of the file it produced.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependencies, not redistributed here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The firmware builds against ESP-IDF (Apache License 2.0) and LVGL (MIT), and the
host builds against the crates listed in host/Cargo.toml. Those are fetched at
build time by the ESP-IDF Component Manager and by Cargo, and their licences
apply to them rather than to this repository.
